OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to fill high street
OL,4,A'eyesore' gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a long-delayed
OL,7,Fproject to fill what has previously
OL,8,Fbeen described as an "eyesore" gap in a
OL,9,Ftown's high street.
OL,11,FThe former Barclays Bank in St Ives,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, has been shrouded in
OL,13,Fscaffolding since planning permission
OL,14,Fwas granted for redevelopment four
OL,15,Fyears ago.
OL,17,FThe St Ives Civic Society had called
OL,18,Ffor Huntingdonshire District Council to
OL,19,Ftake enforcement action to force the
OL,20,Fdeveloper to start work.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
