OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to fill high street
OL,4,A'eyesore' gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service, a spokesperson for
OL,8,Fthe campaign group Action for St Ives
OL,9,Fsaid it "had a response from the
OL,10,Freceivers who have confirmed that the
OL,11,Fdifficulties they were facing have been
OL,12,Fresolved".
